{"id":"n82055-1-9","stage":1,"title":"편의점 · 便利店","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82055-1-9-1","ko":"나 과일 먹고 싶어.","zh":"我想要吃水果。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"과일","meaning":"水果","explanation":"과일：水果","readings":[{"term":"과일","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18264","senseId":"1","lemma":"과일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹고","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싶어.","meaning":"要，想","explanation":"싶다：要，想；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"싶다","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62657","senseId":"1","lemma":"싶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"ed0e90733d1a21cf","term":"과일","zh":"水果","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3","entryId":"18264","definition":"苹果、梨、葡萄、栗子等主要长在树上的，人们可以食用的果子。","pronunciation":["과ː일"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"b3ad33de22cbca64","term":"싶다","zh":"要，想","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3","entryId":"62657","definition":"表示有做前面内容的意图或欲望。","pronunciation":["십따"]}],"audio":"/audio/661d589caabb7245612f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82055-1-9-2","ko":"이 새벽에 무슨 과일이야? 알았어. 편의점에 다녀올게.","zh":"大半夜的吃什么水果啊？好吧，我这就去便利店买。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새벽에","meaning":"凌晨，早晨","explanation":"새벽：凌晨，早晨；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"새벽","audio":"/audio/d0a36389c6b198a158ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62740","senseId":"2","lemma":"새벽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"3","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"과일이야?","meaning":"水果","explanation":"과일：水果；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"과일","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18264","senseId":"1","lemma":"과일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알았어.","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"편의점에","meaning":"便利店，超市","explanation":"편의점：便利店，超市；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"편의점","audio":"/audio/590f2a3e6ebd654080a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82055","senseId":"1","lemma":"편의점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다녀올게.","meaning":"去一趟，去一下","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去一下；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"2","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"d0a36389c6b198a1","term":"새벽","zh":"凌晨，早晨","audio":"/audio/d0a36389c6b198a158ee.mp3","entryId":"62740","definition":"很早的上午时间。","pronunciation":["새벽"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于强调预料之外的、不合理的事情。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"ed0e90733d1a21cf","term":"과일","zh":"水果","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3","entryId":"18264","definition":"苹果、梨、葡萄、栗子等主要长在树上的，人们可以食用的果子。","pronunciation":["과ː일"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于对方的某个命令或请求，同意听从。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"590f2a3e6ebd6540","term":"편의점","zh":"便利店，超市","audio":"/audio/590f2a3e6ebd654080a3.mp3","entryId":"82055","definition":"每天24小时营业，销售简单的生活必需品的店铺。","pronunciation":["펴늬점","펴니점"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去一下","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"为做某事而去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0bc2c06162a0b5bdc53f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.47,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=82055","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.1953,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["大半夜的吃什么水果啊？好吧，我这就去便利店买。","感冒怎么一直好不了啊。","我想要吃水果。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["大半夜的吃什么水果啊？好吧，我这就去便利店买。","我想要吃水果。","感冒怎么一直好不了啊。"],"answer":0}]}
